.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Parse four ``Accept*`` headers used in server-driven content negotiation\&.

The four headers are ``Accept``, ``Accept-Charset``, ``Accept-Encoding`` and
``Accept-Language``\&.

.fi
.PP
 
